This is a copy of the lpc_chip_43xx library from
LPCOpen 3.02, which is licenced under the NXP
LPCOpen license. See individual files for details.

The original LPCOpen package is downloadable at
https://www.nxp.com/design/design-center/software/software-library/lpcopen-software-development-platform-lpc43xx:LPCOPEN-SOFTWARE-FOR-LPC43XX

The only changes to this package are to add CMake support
(see CMakeLists.txt)
